e dedicated to ensuring style and authentic satured products."}}, {"model": "online_store.store", "pk": "4169887e-5ad1-418f-ae63-aedceb1de1ff", "fields": {"owner": 2, "store_name": "J Bomb", "description": "Exclusive store for fashionistas"}}, {"model": "online_store.product", "pk": "86926398-63a4-471a-90ad-2b2f3926d2f9", "fields": {"store": "4169887e-5ad1-418f-ae63-aedceb1de1ff", "product_name": "Mens Eau de Portugal", "price": "789.99", "image": "product_images/Charlotte-Rhys-Men-Au-De-Portugal-No17-01465-Hero_5ERvRpP.webp", "description": "With its sleek, black packaging housing our iconic Victor scent, CHARLOTTE RHYS’ Eau de Portugal looks as good on the shelf as it smells on the skin. This designer fragrance for men is strong and seductive, with a masculine twist.\r\n\r\nEau de Portugal is bold and aromatic, for those seeking a more enigmatic choice."}}, {"model": "online_store.product", "pk": "66a5652e-4d09-40b8-8670-34bc144e14a9", "fields": {"store": "76c5fb6c-e8bd-4a64-b8c0-84207bc0a7c1", "product_name": "Nike AirForce 98", "price": "4099.95", "image": "product_images/custom-nike-air-max-97-shoes-by-you.avif", "description": "The AM97 was the shapeshifter of its time, and it's your turn to do the same. Customise every part of the shoe from upper materials to the colours of the midsole and Nike Air unit, plus non-slip laces to secure the fit. Then, decide whether you want your outsole solid, tinted or translucent. There's even an upgraded insole for extra cushioning underfoot. Finally, a shoe as multifaceted as you."}}, {"model": "online_store.product", "pk": "5b690dc6-f9d7-4c62-bd23-390061068738", "fields": {"store": "53185495-24ff-4dac-ad65-9bb25d3880d8", "product_name": "Nike Air Force 1 - White", "price": "1099.99", "image": "product_images/af1-jpg_cHCchnd.webp", "description": "Stylish Nike Airforce 1 - white, made for comfortability and swag."}}, {"model": "online_store.product", "pk": "993572b0-87dc-4141-a02c-39effd8817bf", "fields": {"store": "5318549